1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
Every fund has work that eats the week.

2
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:04,700
Pulling numbers from filings.

3
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:06,350
Reconciling files.

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,050
Answering the same question again.

5
00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:10,450
We're Otterd.

6
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:14,700
We build AI workflows around the tools your team already uses.

7
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,550
Take a recurring task:

8
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:18,120
bring the sources together,

9
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,400
produce a draft,

10
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:22,980
test outputs with code, and flag exceptions for review.

11
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:25,750
Then we hand the workflow over to you.

12
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,750
On November 10th and 12th, Hiro and Eric are at Greywolf for office hours.

13
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:34,700
To make those days useful, tell us about one task first.

14
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:38,700
Pick a task, from research to compliance to the back office.

15
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:40,200
How often do you do it?

16
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:41,750
How long does it take?

17
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:44,050
What does a good result look like?

18
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:45,800
Choose a sharing lane.

19
00:00:45,970 --> 00:00:48,200
Open: public or routine.

20
00:00:50,470 --> 00:00:53,300
Describe: internal, but not your edge.

21
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:54,800
We'll use a stand-in.

22
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:58,700
Keep: your edge.

23
00:00:58,950 --> 00:01:01,000
Don't send it. We don't need it.

24
00:01:03,270 --> 00:01:05,400
Copy the brief and email it to us.

25
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:10,100
The week before we arrive, we'll build a first version on public or dummy data.

26
00:01:10,410 --> 00:01:12,850
If that week gets busy, skip your slot.

27
00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:16,000
We'll leave a three-minute recording and a one-page note.

28
00:01:16,250 --> 00:01:18,300
Send your brief by November 6th.

29
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:19,600
Ten minutes now.

30
00:01:19,650 --> 00:01:22,160
Something concrete to discuss when we arrive.
